; `key` is SLOT-LOCAL to (track …) — declared inside the track form and
; reachable only through the `key-section` head-set on its positional
; slot. A stray one at the top level therefore resolves against nothing
; and diagnoses; it used to be a plugin-global head and validated clean.
(transport :bpm 120)

(key :at 0b :value 1)
